  "invariants": [
    "The lifter is written in Omega (src/*.om) and is itself convertible by omega-bridge toc to C and Python.",
    "Round trip: bridge(lift(bridge X)) == bridge X byte for byte for scalar function units.",
    "A construct outside the documented subset is refused or skipped with a stderr reason, never guessed.",
    "Output is deterministic; stdout carries only a .om unit, and only on success."
